 * Note that JS reorders integer-like own keys, so a Map is the right container
 * whenever key order matters (as it does for the decoded-claims repr).
 *
 * @param {object} obj the object to write
 * @param {Set<object>} active recursion guard
 * @returns {string} JSON object text
